From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tompta1 <546706+tompta1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:39:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] PCI: apple-h9p: support the J120 T8011 Wi-Fi link

Select the T8011 six-port register layout, native PHY tunables and J120 port-2 power sequence through match data. Validate the Wi-Fi-only DART/MSI profile before hardware setup, retain PERST during REG_ON preparation and disable the link before endpoint teardown. Other controller matches retain their port counts and setup paths; no J120 storage path is enabled.

Assisted-by: LLM
